{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/serro-emaar-properties-the-heights","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1389,"crm_id":"7432","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Serro","slug":"serro-emaar-properties-the-heights","display_address":"The Heights Country Club and Wellness","building_type":["villa"],"completion_year":"2030","developer":"Emaar Properties","price":6500000,"display_price":"6.5M","lattitude":24.975321768,"longitude":55.25393490028,"min_bedrooms":3,"max_bedrooms":5,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Serro at The Heights Dubai is a refined villa enclave by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-emaar-properties/\">Emaar Properties</a>, set within the forest-inspired master community of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/the-heights-country-club-and-wellness-townhouses/\">The Heights Country Club &amp; Wellness</a>. Designed for modern families and long-term homeowners, Serro 1 &amp; Serro 2 offer a curated collection of <strong>3 to 5-bedroom villas</strong> that balance architectural elegance with everyday well-being.</p><p>Surrounded by landscaped gardens, wellness lakes, and shaded walking trails, the community places nature and balance at the center of daily life. Each villa features generous layouts, contemporary finishes, and seamless indoor-outdoor living, creating a calm and private residential environment. Located in Dubai’s emerging growth corridor near Al Maktoum International Airport, Serro The Heights by Emaar combines long-term location strength with a wellness-led lifestyle, making it ideal for both end-users and investors seeking lasting value.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_8babd2b28e.jpg","h